; THE WRLD OS visual style. Edit the values below, or copy this file under a new
; name (and change Name=) to create your own style. Colours are #RRGGBB or "none".
; Vista Aero: the first Aero glass - darker, smokier glass and a black glass taskbar.

[Style]
Name=Vista Aero
Renderer=aero
Description=Smoky dark glass, a black glass taskbar and a glowing orb.
Base=Aero
Wallpaper=Northern lights

